<attribute name="problem" nodeId="cc5f20c7">&lt;p&gt;
    EY&apos;s RacOR (Rapid Application Conversion for Oracle Cloud ERP) automates conversion and configuration uploads.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    It can be used on Oracle cloud rapid implementations to enable the migration of data from source systems to Oracle
    cloud. It also provides automated transformation and validation capabilities and data upload to Oracle cloud along with
    data reconciliation support. Additionally, it can be used to configure tasks in cloud ERP, thereby saving time during
    configuration setup.&amp;nbsp;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    &lt;img class=&quot;fitImage&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; src=&quot;./../../../process.adv.eya_oracle.base/guidances/practices/resources/racor.jpg&quot; /&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
